doc:article-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "3 The following should be punishable as ordinary crimes:" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "(1) Any fraudulent making or altering of currency, whatever means are employed; (2) The fraudulent uttering of counterfeit currency;  Schedule  International Convention for the Suppression of Counterfeiting Currency  Crimes (Currency) Act 1981  Compilation date: 11/5/18 Registered: 23/5/18  (3) The introduction into a country of or the receiving or obtaining counterfeit currency with a view to uttering the same and with knowledge that it is counterfeit; (4) Attempts to commit, and any intentional participation in, the foregoing acts; (5) The fraudulent making, receiving or obtaining of instruments or other articles peculiarly adapted for the counterfeiting or altering of currency." ;
    cof:pageNumber "29"^^xsd:integer .

concept:crimes-currency-act-1981-article-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "4 Each of the acts mentioned in Article 3, if they are committed in different"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:article-4 ;
    values:originalText "countries, should be considered as a distinct offence." ;
