doc:article-14-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "14(2) Each central office should, so far as it considers expedient, forward to the" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) Investigation and prosecutions in cases of counterfeiting, and arrests, convictions and expulsions of counterfeiters, and also, where possible, their  International Convention for the Suppression of Counterfeiting Currency  Schedule  Crimes (Currency) Act 1981 Compilation date: 11/5/18 Registered: 23/5/18  movements, together with any details which may be of use, and in particular their descriptions, finger-prints and photographs;" ;
    cof:pageNumber "32"^^xsd:integer .

