concept:crimes-currency-act-1981-article-18 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "18 The present Convention does not affect the principle that the offences"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:article-18 ;
    values:originalText "referred to in Article 3 should in each country, without ever being allowed impunity, be defined, prosecuted and punished in conformity with the general rules of its domestic law." ;
