concept:crimes-currency-act-1981-article-23 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "23 Schedule  International Convention for the Suppression of Counterfeiting Currency"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:article-23 ;
    values:originalText "Crimes (Currency) Act 1981  Compilation date: 11/5/18 Registered: 23/5/18  Ratification of or accession to the present Convention by any High Contracting Party implies that its legislation and its administrative organisation are in conformity with the rules contained in the Convention." ;
