doc:article-28-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "28(3) The present Convention shall be registered by the Secretariat of the League" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) That the rule contained in Article 4 of the Convention in no way modifies internal regulations establishing penalties in the event of concurrent offences. It does not prevent the same individual, who is both forger and utterer, from being prosecuted as forger only." ;
    cof:pageNumber "37"^^xsd:integer .

concept:crimes-currency-act-1981-article-28-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "28(4) The present Convention shall be registered by the Secretariat of the League"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:article-28-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) That High Contracting Parties are required to execute letters of request only within the limits provided for by their domestic law.  II. RESERVATIONS The High Contracting Parties who make the reservations set forth hereunder make their acceptance of the Convention conditional on the said reservations; their participation, subject to the said reservations, is accepted by the other High Contracting Parties." ;
